      "problem_type": "textbook_exercise",
      "problem_text": "如圖，D、E、F分別為\\({\\overline{ AB }}\\)、\\({\\overline{ BC }}\\)、\\({\\overline{ AC }}\\)三邊的中點，若\\(\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\vec{a}\\)、\\(\\overrightarrow{AF}=\\vec{b}\\)，試以\\(\\vec{a}\\)、\\(\\vec{b}\\)表示下列各向量：\n(1)\\(\\overrightarrow{DB}\\) (2)\\(\\overrightarrow{ED}\\) (3)\\(\\overrightarrow{EF}\\)"
    },
    {
      "source_description": "3-1習題 基礎題 2",
      "skill_id": "vh_數學B2_SubSection_3_1_2",
      "problem_type": "textbook_exercise",
      "problem_text": "如圖，在四邊形ABCD中，試求下列各向量的和：\n(1)\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\ +\\overrightarrow{BC}\\) (2)\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\ +\\overrightarrow{BC}\\ +\\overrightarrow{CD}\\)\n(3)\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\ +\\overrightarrow{BC}\\ +\\overrightarrow{CD}\\ +\\overrightarrow{DA}\\)"
    },
    {
      "source_description": "3-1習題 基礎題 3",
      "skill_id": "vh_數學B2_SubSection_3_1_3",
      "problem_type": "textbook_exercise",
      "problem_text": "如圖，在四邊形ABCD中，試化簡下列各向量：\n(1)\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\ -\\overrightarrow{AC}\\) (2)\\(\\overrightarrow{AC}\\ -\\overrightarrow{DC}\\)"
