      "skill_id": "vh_數學B2_SubSection_3_1_4",
      "problem_type": "textbook_exercise",
      "problem_text": "如圖所示有\\(\\vec{a}\\)、\\(\\vec{b}\\)、\\(\\vec{c}\\)三個向量，填入實數完成下列空格：\n(1)\\(\\vec{a}=\\) \\(\\vec{b}\\) (2)\\(\\vec{b}=\\) \\(\\vec{a}\\)\n(3)\\(\\vec{c}=\\) \\(\\vec{b}\\)"
    },
    {
      "source_description": "3-1習題 基礎題 8",
      "skill_id": "vh_數學B2_SubSection_3_1_4",
